OL,3,CCold case appeal for woman found dead
OL,4,Cin Merseyside field 32 years ago
OL,6,FPeople with information about the
OL,7,Fmurder of a woman 32 years ago may not
OL,8,Fhave come forward at the time out of
OL,9,F"loyalty or fear", police have said.
OL,11,FJulie Finley, 23, was strangled and
OL,12,Fher naked body was dumped in a carrot
OL,13,Ffield near the Rainford bypass, north-
OL,14,Fwest of St Helens in Merseyside in
OL,15,F1994.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@QO]
