PN,36102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786281505
OL,3,CCold case appeal for woman found dead
OL,4,Cin Merseyside field 32 years ago
OL,6,FA cyclist discovered her body at
OL,7,Flunchtime on August 6 after she was
OL,8,Flast seen alive at about 11 o'clock
OL,9,Fthe night before at the back of the
OL,10,FRoyal Liverpool University Hospital
OL,11,Ftalking to an unknown white man of
OL,12,Faverage height and build and aged in
OL,13,Fhis 20s or 30s.
OL,15,FMore than three decades on, Merseyside
OL,16,FPolice have launched a fresh appeal
OL,17,Ffor information about her death.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786281505
OL,3,CCold case appeal for woman found dead
OL,4,Cin Merseyside field 32 years ago
OL,6,FDetective Inspector Sam Davies from
OL,7,Fthe major incident team said: "It is
OL,8,F32 years since Julie was murdered but
OL,9,Fthe investigation into her death
OL,10,Fremains ongoing.
OL,12,F"We know that back in 1994 people may
OL,13,Fhave had information about Julie's
OL,14,Fdeath which, either through loyalty or
OL,15,Ffear, they didn't bring to our
OL,16,Fattention.
OL,26,@oD@_OUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786281505
OL,3,CCold case appeal for woman found dead
OL,4,Cin Merseyside field 32 years ago
OL,6,F"My message would be it is never too
OL,7,Flate to do the right thing and tell us
OL,8,Fwhat you know, no matter how small.
OL,9,FOne piece of information could be key
OL,10,Fto solving the case and bringing the
OL,11,Fperson responsible to justice."
OL,13,FA witness at the time said he saw a
OL,14,Fyoung woman matching the victim's
OL,15,Fdescription arguing with a man at
OL,16,Fabout 12.30am on August 6 outside the
OL,17,FWheatsheaf public house in Rainford,
OL,18,Fjust 50 yards from where Miss Finley's
OL,19,Fbody was found later that day.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
