OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786281505
OL,3,CCold case appeal for woman found dead
OL,4,Cin Merseyside field 32 years ago
OL,6,FThe unknown man was reportedly
OL,7,Fattempting to force the young woman
OL,8,Finto a white transit van, police said.
OL,10,FIn 2014, Miss Finley's elderly parents
OL,11,Freleased a set of photographs from her
OL,12,Fchildhood in a bid to shake someone's
OL,13,Fconscience and provide new information.
OL,15,FAt that time, Miss Finley's mother
OL,16,Fsaid: "Albie and I have been put
OL,17,Fthrough 20 years of hell and torment
OL,18,Fand Julie's sudden and tragic loss has
OL,19,Faffected the whole family.
OL,26,@xD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1786281505
OL,3,CCold case appeal for woman found dead
OL,4,Cin Merseyside field 32 years ago
OL,6,F"It's difficult to explain what the
OL,7,Flast 20 years have been like, but for
OL,8,Fme I still feel like it's 1994 and I'm
OL,9,Fconstantly waiting for Julie to come
OL,10,Fthrough the door, but she never does
OL,11,Fand never will."
OL,13,FPolice have said they "remain
OL,14,Fcommitted" to helping Miss Finley's
OL,15,Ffamily get justice.
OL,17,FAnyone with information about her
OL,18,Fdeath has been asked to message
OL,19,F@MerPolCC, call 101 or contact
OL,20,FCrimestoppers anonymously by calling
OL,21,F0800 555 111.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@PO]uD@WOUvD@JO]
